name: the shared house is consulted before the reader's own
file: addons/Family/Scanners/Auctions.lua
--- old
	return freshest(lookup.mine or {}, variant, not ignoreBans)
		or freshest(lookup.shared or {}, variant, not ignoreBans)
--- new
	return freshest(lookup.shared or {}, variant, not ignoreBans)
		or freshest(lookup.mine or {}, variant, not ignoreBans)
